 and a searchable inventory, the platform simplifies the car-buying process. It is a subsidiary of Cox Automotive and maintains a focus on delivering a transparent, efficient digital experience for vehicle shoppers.", "external": {"facebook": {"id": "autotrader"}, "instagram": {"id": "autotrader_com"}, "twitter": {"id": "autotrader_com"}, "wikidata": {"id": "Q4826084"}}, "founded_year": "1997", "headquartered": "Atlanta", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/2CED8EBB-6DFF-478C-B301-A266D4BACA71-420x-auto.jpg"}, "inception": "1997-01-01", "industry": ["e-commerce"], "official_site": "https://www.autotrader.com", "products": [], "short_description": "Autotrader is an online marketplace for buying and selling new, used, and certified cars, SUVs, and trucks, offering vehicle listings, research tools, and car deals.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Ein umfassender digitaler Marktplatz, der Autokäufer mit Inseraten für neue und gebrauchte Fahrzeuge von Händlern und Privatverkäufern verbindet."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Un mercado digital integral que conecta a compradores de coches con listados de vehículos nuevos y usados de concesionarios y vendedores particulares."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A comprehensive digital marketplace connecting car shoppers with new and used vehicle listings from dealers and private sellers."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Un marché numérique complet qui met en relation les acheteurs de voitures avec des annonces de véhicules neufs et d'occasion provenant de concessionnaires et de particuliers."}], "subsidiary": []}, "popularity": 0.8487565899883033, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Online marketplaces of the United States", "tag_id": "urn:tag:wikipedia_category:online_marketplaces_of_the_united_states", "type": "urn:tag:wikipedia_category"}, {"name": "Website", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:website", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Advertising Enabled", "tag_id": "urn:tag:platform_featu